#![enable(implicit_some)]
// Reference soils with exponent n != 1, for the soil benches and oracles (the textbook cases of spike S4). They are not WORLD's course table:
// WORLD owns content/world/materials.ron. SI units: kc in Pa/m^(n-1), kphi in Pa/m^n, cohesion in Pa, K in m.
[
    MaterialDef(
        name: "lete_sand",
        mu_peak: Param(v: 0.6, lo: 0.420, hi: 0.780, prov: Estimate, src: "UNVALIDATED stand-in; shoe friction on the surface, order of magnitude"),
